    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay your way to victory!</h2><br>Dodge, slash, block, and parry your way to freedom! Defeat over 11 monstrous beasts to uncover the dark truth that lurks in the depths of the Sadist King's castle. Featuring retro graphics heavily inspired by the Atari 2600:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/a28b6715cf496ae064fd634ebeaf3c29.poster.avif?t=1721444126\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/a28b6715cf496ae064fd634ebeaf3c29.webm?t=1721444126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/a28b6715cf496ae064fd634ebeaf3c29.mp4?t=1721444126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped in the keep of the Sadist King, a fate worse than death.</h2><br>You play the role of a lone soul on a quest to save the Princess of Whitebridge, captured by the Sadist King. The King has agreed to let you live if you can conquer the towering beasts that occupy his castle\u2019s hold, but nothing will satisfy his insatiable appetite for the stench of blood. <br><br>Don the armor of the illustrious Big Heavy, once known as the savior of Woodsvale and eradicator of the withering plague. Claim your freedom and return to Whitebridge a hero.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/63c08471d711359509070c1a0cb8c4cc.poster.avif?t=1721444126\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/63c08471d711359509070c1a0cb8c4cc.webm?t=1721444126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/63c08471d711359509070c1a0cb8c4cc.mp4?t=1721444126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay your way to victory!</h2><br>Dodge, slash, block, and parry your way to freedom! Defeat over 11 monstrous beasts to uncover the dark truth that lurks in the depths of the Sadist King's castle. Featuring retro graphics heavily inspired by the Atari 2600:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/a28b6715cf496ae064fd634ebeaf3c29.poster.avif?t=1721444126\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/a28b6715cf496ae064fd634ebeaf3c29.webm?t=1721444126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/a28b6715cf496ae064fd634ebeaf3c29.mp4?t=1721444126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped in the keep of the Sadist King, a fate worse than death.</h2><br>You play the role of a lone soul on a quest to save the Princess of Whitebridge, captured by the Sadist King. The King has agreed to let you live if you can conquer the towering beasts that occupy his castle\u2019s hold, but nothing will satisfy his insatiable appetite for the stench of blood. <br><br>Don the armor of the illustrious Big Heavy, once known as the savior of Woodsvale and eradicator of the withering plague. Claim your freedom and return to Whitebridge a hero.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/63c08471d711359509070c1a0cb8c4cc.poster.avif?t=1721444126\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/63c08471d711359509070c1a0cb8c4cc.webm?t=1721444126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606590/extras/63c08471d711359509070c1a0cb8c4cc.mp4?t=1721444126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
